    "compose": {
      "loops": 2,
      "exit": {
        "effect": "fade",
        "duration": 0.5
      },
      "note": "Telegram plays an animation in a loop. The card lasts two loops of the background; the texts come in at the start and fade out in the last 0.5 s, so the restart is clean. D = loops * duration."
